prompts.activity:
Create a transparent pixel-art game badge atlas, EXACTLY 6 columns by 4 rows, 24 isolated badges centered in equal square cells, large transparent gaps. Hard square pixel clusters and flat 3-tone colors, cozy 32-bit collectible items. Different silhouettes, round/square/cutout, NOT generic commercial achievement icons. These are fan-game reinterpretations of SEEYA fandom keepsakes. No trophies, musical instruments, headphones, piano, crowns, generic awards. Reference 1: actual SEEYA pink-handled clear round globe lightstick with pink 20 floral insert. Reference 2: Yeonji fan puppy globe lightstick with floppy cream ears. Reference 3: tour paper slogan, standing ring calendar and acrylic all-concert ticket. Reference 4: dark purple tour paper slogan. Use these recognizable shapes. Read row-major:
1 SEEYA pink handle round globe lightstick with floral 20 insert;
2 purple tour slogan banner with three tiny pink stars;
3 three connected pink round globe lightsticks with wrist straps;
4 folded rose tour slogan with cream ticket;
5 clear acrylic all-concert ticket with pink block markings;
6 three little pixel fans holding the pink globe lightsticks;
7 puppy-eared cream fan globe lightstick;
8 miniature SEEYA lightstick keychain with silver ring;
9 pink and lilac two-key keycap keyring;
10 single pink polaroid with three tiny singer silhouettes;
11 fan photocards fanned out in three colors;
12 transparent decorated photocard holder with pink ribbon;
13 pink hand-written fan envelope with three tiny hearts;
14 bundled three fan letters tied with lavender ribbon;
15 navy rolled paper slogan beside pink globe lightstick;
16 cream spiral standing calendar with pink SEEYA mark;
17 blue three-singer acrylic standee on clear base;
18 round pink birthday pin with tiny brown-haired pixel singer;
19 blue square birthday pin with tiny black-haired pixel singer;
20 pink heart birthday pin with tiny red-haired pixel singer;
21 transparent ticket charm with pink strap;
22 purple concert ticket binder with three tabs;
23 fan sticker sheet with three chibi singer faces;
24 keepsake box containing pink globe lightstick, slogan, polaroid.
No extra text other than tiny SEEYA mark where readable. Each design fully contained in its own cell, no connecting lines, no cast shadows, no background. Output landscape 1536x1024.
